      </reference>
      <name value="Carboplatin and Paclitaxel (CP) — Variant #83 (Carbo AUC 5 + Paclitaxel 175 mg/m² q21d)"/>
      <description value="One executable variant of the Carboplatin + Paclitaxel regimen (HemOnc cui 2554). Single 21-day cycle pattern repeated 3–6 times: Carboplatin target AUC 5 + Paclitaxel 175 mg/m², both IV on day 1. Sourced from HemOncKB sigs.csv snapshot 2026-03-12 (variant_cui 144842, first reported in the MITO-2 trial). This Phase 0 artifact does not include premedications, dose-modification rules, or hold-for-counts logic — those are deferred to subsequent Library resources."/>
      <exampleBoolean value="false"/>
    </resource>
